From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bumba <noreply@bumba>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 05:10:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Reuse Ninja workers and wake on jobserver tokens

Replace per-edge thread creation with a fixed worker pool and poll worker notifications together with the GNU jobserver.

---
